  "question": {
    "text": "A block of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> slides down on a rough inclined plane with constant velocity. The angle made by the incline plane with horizontal is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>. The magnitude of the contact force will be :",
